WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:07.000
No matter how our imperial family struggles internally, this realm shall forever bear the surname of Sikong!

00:14.520 --> 00:19.000
Come... let us go home.

00:22.760 --> 00:30.500
In the 7th year of Changle, the Prince of Jin led reinforcements to the northern front, repelling the Wutu invaders and safeguarding the empire.
